entry.summary:
I love GitHub Unwrapped because it lets me see all the progress (or lack of progress) I've made over the past year. Sidenote: I will be posting my GitHub Unwrapped on December 31st. I wanted to take that idea one step further. So instead of just looking at my stats, I built an MCP App that: Pulls your GitHub activity for 2025 Shows you your commits, repos, top languages, and more Gives you one roast And one compliment Here's my repo.
